   "house": "representatives",
   "question": "The majority voted against amendments introduced by Wannon MP [Dan Tehan](https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/people/representatives/wannon/dan_tehan) (Liberal), which means they will not be included in the bill. The amendments related to excluded occupations. ### Amendment text > *(1) Schedule 1, item 4, page 5 (line 10), before \"different kinds of occupations\", insert \"subject to subsection (5A),\".* > > *(2) Schedule 1, item 4, page 5 (after line 11), after subsection 140GB(5), insert:* > >> *(5A) None of the following kinds of occupations may be prescribed for the purposes of subparagraph (2)(c)(iii):* >> >>> *(a) trade workers;* >>> >>> *(b) machinery operators or drivers;* >>> >>> *(c) labourers.*",
